23","text":"Single-stranded nucleic acid binding protein that binds preferentially to oligo dC."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}